	"contenido": "<p>De acuerdo con la información&nbsp;técnica proporcionada por Conaf,&nbsp;respecto a los incendios forestales en la Región del Biobío,&nbsp;se informa el siguiente detalle:</p><p>​</p><table><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Comuna</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">Santa Juana</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Nombre del incendio</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">La Generala</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Estado</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">En Combate</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Superficie</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">2.2 hectáreas</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Observaciones</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">Las 50 personas evacuadas de Santa   Juana se encuentran albergados en la escuela de Chacay.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><table><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Comuna</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">Tirúa</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Nombre del incendio</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">Cementerio Tirúa</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Estado</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">Controlado</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Superficie</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">6.4 hectáreas</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right: 2.55pt;margin-left: 0cm;text-align: justify\"><strong>Observaciones</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">El incendio se desarrolla cercano a   sectores habitados.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>​</p><table><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Comuna</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">Mulchén</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Nombre del incendio</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">Las Mercedes</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Estado</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">En Combate</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Superficie</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">200 hectáreas</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Comuna</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">Tucapel</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Nombre del incendio</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">HJ. Huacha</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Estado</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">Controlado</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Superficie</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">17 hectáreas</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p><p><br></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Comuna</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">Tirúa</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Nombre del incendio</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">Curapaillaco</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Estado</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">Controlado</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Superficie</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">3.1 hectáreas</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Comuna</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">Hualqui</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Nombre del incendio</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">Los Copihues II</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Estado</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">En combate</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Superficie</strong></p></td><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">35 hectáreas</p></td></tr><tr><td><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><strong>Observaciones</strong></p></td><td><p>Municipio informa que la escuela D-600 se encuentra habilitada   para alojamiento de brigadistas CONAF que vienen en apoyo del combate.</p><p style=\"margin-right:2.55pt;margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\">Escuela   Ranguel y Escuela Talcamavida habilitadas como albergues.</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>En consideración a estos antecedentes y en base a la información técnica proporcionada por CONAF, en coordinación con la Delegación Presidencial Regional de Biobío, la Dirección Regional de SENAPRED <strong>mantiene la Alerta Roja para la Región de Biobío</strong>, por incendio forestal, que se encuentra vigente desde el 23 de marzo de 2025.</p>",
